@startuml
title D-05 Continuity Terminal Restricted Operation Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Cashier
actor Supervisor
participant "Continuity Terminal\n(disabled by default)" as Terminal
participant "Operator Console /\nApproved Workflow" as Console
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Central PMS /\nDiscount Workflow" as Discount
participant "Site POS Server" as POS

Supervisor -> Console : approve activation where required
Console -> Terminal : enable scoped continuity workflow
Cashier -> Terminal : scan / enter ticket or card
Terminal -> Central : continuity lookup
Central --> Terminal : approved basis or fail-closed result

opt statutory discount requested
  Terminal -> Discount : submit only if policy allows
  alt safe validation possible
    Discount --> Central : validation result and payable effect
    Central --> Terminal : updated payable basis
  else unsafe validation
    Discount --> Terminal : route to supervisor / fail closed
  end
end

Terminal -> Central : payment workflow where allowed
Central -> POS : fiscal issuance where available and allowed
POS --> Central : fiscal status
Central --> Terminal : customer instruction / pending status

note over Terminal
All activity is incident-tagged,
audit-tagged, and reconciliation-tagged.
end note

@enduml
